  "prompt_text": "Continue the given text:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" You look around and see a swarm of bees, all bowing to you.\n\n\"Oh!\" said the princess, quite alarmed. \"I don't know what to say! There are so many of you.\" \n\n\"We are at your service, Your Majesty,\" said the bees, bowing low. \"Anything you desire is our pleasure.\"",
